DTEND:20261031T120000Z
SUMMARY:Upcoming maintenance for the Customers Portal
DESCRIPTION:We’ll be performing database maintenance for the Customers Por
 tal (customers.gitlab.com) on Saturday\, 31 October\, from 11:00 to 12:00 
 UTC. We apologize for the short notice. This maintenance is needed to help
  preserve stability.\n\nThe Customers Portal and its APIs will be temporar
 ily unavailable during this window. We’ll update this notice when the main
 tenance begins and when it’s complete.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:000-mrwygx@status.io
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20261007T165144Z
DTSTART:20261007T165144Z
DTEND:20261007T180425Z
SUMMARY:Job delays on saas-linux-small-amd64 hosted runners
DESCRIPTION:An incident affecting CI/CD jobs on GitLab.com instance runner
 s has been resolved. Job pickup delays should no longer be occurring and w
 e are continuing to monitor to confirm full recovery. Details in: https://
 gitlab.com/gitlab-com/gl-infra/production/-/work_items/23117
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:000-svb5ts@status.io
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20261016T113300Z
DTSTART:20261016T113300Z
DTEND:20261016T132123Z
SUMMARY:GitLab.com CI/CD Incident
DESCRIPTION:We’re investigating an issue affecting CI/CD on GitLab.com for
  a limited number of customers.  Pipelines may fail with the following err
 or\, and the UI may be slow:\n“CI configuration fetch from Gitaly timed ou
 t. This may indicate Gitaly service slowness or an outage.” \nMore updates
  to follow.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0000y86d10@status.io
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20261014T143300Z
DTSTART:20261014T143300Z
DTEND:20261014T183021Z
SUMMARY:GitLab.com CI/CD pipelines delayed or not starting
DESCRIPTION:We are investigating an issue affecting GitLab.com merge train
 s. Some merge train pipelines may remain in the created state for an exten
 ded period or fail to start\, causing merge trains and related CI/CD workf
 lows to stall. More details: https://gitlab.com/gitlab-com/gl-infra/produc
 tion/-/work_items/23192
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:000-fgwh19@status.io
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20261008T155948Z
DTSTART:20261008T155948Z
DTEND:20261008T183329Z
SUMMARY:Delayed job completion
DESCRIPTION:We are currently investigating delays in job completion: CI jo
 bs remain running after success\, delaying pipeline progression. Details h
 ttps://gitlab.com/gitlab-com/gl-infra/production/-/work_items/23133 
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:000-d1p19c@status.io
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20250907T120000Z
DTSTART:20250907T120000Z
DTEND:20250907T150000Z
SUMMARY:Gitaly Storage Node Upgrade
DESCRIPTION:The gitaly storage nodes will be upgraded. There may be brief\
 , short-lived disruptions during the upgrade\; however\, no action is requ
 ired from customers before or after the upgrade. Retrying operations shoul
 d be sufficient once the service is restored.
END:VEVENT
